  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints : $\\mathrm{H}^{+}(\\mathrm{pH}=10)\\left|\\mathrm{H}_2(1 \\mathrm{~atm})\\right| \\operatorname{Pt}(\\mathrm{s})$\nReaction: $2 \\mathrm{H}^{+}\\left(\\mathrm{p}^{\\mathrm{H}}=10\\right)+2 \\mathrm{e} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{H}_2(1 \\mathrm{~atm})$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{E}=\\mathrm{E}^0-\\frac{0.0591}{2} \\log \\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{H}_2}}{\\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right]^2}\\right) \\\\\n& =0-\\frac{0.0591}{2} \\log \\frac{1}{\\left(10^{-10}\\right)^2}=-\\frac{0.0591}{2} \\times 2 \\log \\frac{1}{10^{-10}}=-0.0591 \\times 10=-0.591 \\\\\n& \\text { i.e. } E=-0.591 \\mathrm{~V} \\\\\n&\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
  }
